.TH "TreeSitter" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "treesitter 0.1.0" "treesitter API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
TreeSitter \- Bindings to the Tree\-sitter C library (0.25 or newer, linked through \fB\%pkg\-config\fR): grammars loaded from shared libraries at run time (\fB\%Language.load\fR), incremental parsing (\fB\%Parser\fR, \fB\%Tree#edit\fR), syntax nodes (\fB\%Node\fR) and queries with the common predicates (\fB\%Query\fR).
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "treesitter"\fR
.sp
\fBmodule TreeSitter\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
Bindings to the Tree\-sitter C library (0.25 or newer, linked through \fB\%pkg\-config\fR): grammars loaded from shared
libraries at run time (\fB\%Language.load\fR), incremental parsing (\fB\%Parser\fR, \fB\%Tree#edit\fR), syntax nodes (\fB\%Node\fR) and
queries with the common predicates (\fB\%Query\fR). Offsets are bytes into UTF\-8 text; points are rows and byte columns.
